    {
      "name": "Unlock driver moods",
      "description": "Waze's mood picker is gated three ways: an eligibility check that accepts only one mood name (and reads the beta-moods flag), a baby-account gate that hides moods, and a filtered native catalogue call. This opens all three, so moods already in the local catalogue - including special and hidden entries - become selectable. Artwork Waze has never downloaded is not invented.",
      "default": true,
      "category": null,
      "dependencies": [
        "ResourcePatch"
      ],
